                        "entry_id": "a1919635-733b-375e-95a6-c0504e6f4bb3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ascetic (related to Ascetics)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "69b693ea-51ba-4247-af25-eaf7dab15edd",
                                "sense_id": "0ea9ce94-8ded-335a-87e0-deed5610d8c6",
                                "text": "Эти предпосылки достаточно аскетичны – более аскетичны, чем те, которые выбрал Лорен Ломаски, строя свою концепцию фундаментальных либеральных прав на представлении об индивидуумах как исполнителях тех или иных проектов.",
                                "translation": "These premises are quite ascetic – more ascetic than those chosen by Laurent Lomasky, who based his conception of fundamental liberal rights on the idea of individuals as executors of various projects.",
                                "english": "These premises are quite ascetic – more ascetic than those chosen by Laurent Lomasky, who based his conception of fundamental liberal rights on the idea of individuals as executors of various projects."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
